&lt;p&gt;Aquest dissabte, intens dissabte, va tocar passar-se a lluir el pel (o la falta d&amp;rsquo;aquest en el meu cas) pel &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/cjprospe/"&gt;Casal de Joves de Prosperitat&lt;/a&gt;
.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Allà es va celebrar el &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/metal.nightmare/p/DHbT_BOiMOq/?api=%e9%95%bf%e6%b2%bb%e6%89%be%e5%b0%8f%e5%a7%90%e5%bf%ab%e9%a4%90%e5%85%a8%e5%a5%97%e4%b8%8a%e9%97%a8%e6%9c%8d%e5%8a%a1%7B%e5%be%ae%e4%bf%a11646224%e7%9c%9f%e5%ae%9e%e4%b8%8a%e9%97%a8%7D-%e9%95%bf%e6%b2%bb%e5%93%aa%e9%87%8c%e6%9c%89%e5%b0%8f%e5%a7%90%e5%bf%ab%e9%a4%90%e5%85%a8%e5%a5%97%e6%9c%8d%e5%8a%a1-%e9%95%bf%e6%b2%bb%e6%80%8e%e4%b9%88%e6%89%be%e5%85%a8%e5%a5%97%e5%b0%8f%e5%a7%90%e4%b8%8a%e9%97%a8%e6%9c%8d%e5%8a%a1-%e9%95%bf%e6%b2%bb%e5%90%8c%e5%9f%8e%e6%9c%8d%e5%8a%a1%e5%bf%ab%e9%a4%90%e5%85%a8%e5%a5%97%e5%b0%8f%e5%a7%90%e4%b8%8a%e9%97%a8%e6%9c%8d%e5%8a%a1.muhz&amp;amp;hl=pa"&gt;Prospehell Metal Fest&lt;/a&gt;
 que ve a ser un aquelarre de peluts fent molt soroll i gent rockanrolejant a tope. Serà la meva veterania, però va sorpendrem gratament la curta edat dels membres de les formacions que vaig poder veure.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>